<title>GREECE: EARTHQUAKE SHAKES NORTHERN ATHENIAN SUBURBS.</title>
<headline>EARTHQUAKE SHAKES NORTHERN ATHENIAN SUBURBS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake measuring 4.5 on the Richter scale shook Athens' northern suburbs at 0441 local today, the state Athens News Agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>Its epicentre was located in the sea bed off the port of Kimi on the island of Evia 85 kilometres from Athens, the statement said.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
